# Generated Python profile modules are compared BYTE FOR BYTE against a fresh
# regeneration by `tools/test_ftp75_profile.py`
# (`test_gen_ftp75_profile_regenerates_both_modules_byte_identically`).  The
# generator writes LF; with the global `core.autocrlf true` this checkout uses,
# git rewrites them to CRLF on checkout and the comparison fails on line endings
# alone.  It is an ENVIRONMENT failure, not a content one, and it bites every
# fresh worktree (recorded 2026-09-03, MPC single-source review round).
#
# `-text` disables end-of-line conversion for these two files in both
# directions, so a worktree gets them exactly as committed.
tools/ftp75_profile.py -text
tools/ftp75c_profile.py -text
